              "exact_quote": "Well, it's the uncovered interest parity condition."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "CON_0018",
              "exact_quote": "An increase in the domestic interest rate leads to a higher exchange rate, meaning the domestic currency becomes more expensive."
            },
            {
